{"slug":"Universal-Script-Fe-Physics-Gun-aboaooaosbdbaoaoboabdoaboabd-160896","_id":"69c81b12809beaaa5b8642c1","title":"Fe Physics Gun aboaooaosbdbaoaoboabdoaboabd","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":"/images/sb/0-1774721810442.png","placeId":0},"features":"TOGGLE ON DEL\n\n🔥 MAIN FEATURES:\n\n🌍 Simulation Radius Bypass: Automatically grants infinite Network Ownership (math.huge), allowing you to grab and control unanchored parts from across the entire map!\n🔍 Deep Scan (BFS Algorithm): Doesn't just grab a single part; it uses a Breadth-First Search algorithm to grab the entire connected model perfectly.\n🔪 Kill Grab (Blender Mode): Spins the grabbed object at insane speeds. Touch a player with it, and they will be instantly shredded/flung!\n🛡️ Smart Safe Collision: Ghost mode only for your character! The object will pass through your body (preventing accidental self-flinging) but will still collide with other players and the map.\n🧠 Hidden Use (Telekinesis): Hides the gun and custom animations. Looks like you are controlling objects with your mind!\n🧊 Advanced Freeze System: Freeze objects perfectly in mid-air using AlignPosition/Orientation (Key: F). Unfreeze all with X.\n🚀 Null Fling & Legacy Fling: Launch objects into the absolute void at light speed (Key: R).\n👻 Ignore World & Noclip Grab: Raycast ignores walls so you can grab items inside buildings. Noclip Grab makes the item pass through everything for the whole server.\n⚙️ PHYSICS CONTROLS:\n\n⚡ Infinite Power: Uses math.huge to force-move objects regardless of their weight.\n🛑 Anti-Sway & Anti-Rotation: Removes rubber-banding and locks the object's angle perfectly while holding it.\n🔄 Modern vs Legacy Physics: Swap between modern AlignPosition or legacy BodyPosition on the fly.\n🎮 KEYBINDS:\n\n[ Click + Hold ] - Grab Object\n[ Q / E ] - Move object closer / further away\n[ Z ] - Reset object distance (15 studs)\n[ F ] - Freeze the held object in mid-air\n[ X ] - Unfreeze ALL frozen objects\n[ R ] - Fling object to the void\n[ B ] - Spawn a Companion Cube (Weighted Storage Cube)\n[ Delete ] - Toggle UI\n🎨 VISUALS & UI:\n\nReal 3D Mesh: Custom PhysGun model with an animated laser beam tracking the object.\nGMod Animations (R6): Custom holding and looking animations that aim the gun where your camera looks.\nClean Hub: A fully draggable, modern GUI with stroke highlights and toggles for every single feature.","tags":["PhysicsGun","Physic"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LOLKEK12322/PhysicsGunLuaScript/refs/heads/main/PhysicsGun'),true))()","owner":{"_id":"67f68ae1f913ab2c0e0db4cd","username":"Lolkek123","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/67f68ae1f913ab2c0e0db4cd-1788041788204.png","status":"offline","id":"67f68ae1f913ab2c0e0db4cd","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"views":8930,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/0-1774721810442.png","likeCount":5,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-03-28T18:16:50.457Z","keyLink":"","executes":11080,"keyless":false,"milestones":[{"key":"script.executions","tier":10000,"value":10002,"at":"2026-10-05T21:30:06.359Z"}],"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69c81b12809beaaa5b8642c4","editBy":{"_id":"67f68ae1f913ab2c0e0db4cd","username":"Lolkek123","status":"offline","id":"67f68ae1f913ab2c0e0db4cd"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-03-28T18:16:50.461Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69c81e340aae7ef6c4d7d0b6","commentBy":{"_id":"685d57fc2206934a9ce32d49","username":"NPCNOk","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/photo/685d57fc2206934a9ce32d49-1777621348457.png","createdAt":"2025-06-26T14:23:56.615Z","lastActive":"2026-05-16T07:22:01.038Z","status":"offline","id":"685d57fc2206934a9ce32d49","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":25}},"text":"HMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM LE